      "writtenOn": "2018-11-21T11:13:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of keeping this a free type variable, can\u0027t we just produce uint8_t if F is const, const uint8_t if F is non-const (i.e. 2 overloads)?\n\nSomething like this:\n\ntemplate\u003ctypename F\u003e\nfuzz::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e ToSpan(F* field) {\n  return fuzz::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e(reinterpret_cast\u003cuint8_t*\u003e(field), sizeof(*field));\n}\n\ntemplate\u003ctypename F\u003e\nfuzz::span\u003cconst uint8_t\u003e ToSpan(const F* field) {\n  return fuzz::span\u003cconst uint8_t\u003e(reinterpret_cast\u003cconst uint8_t*\u003e(field), sizeof(*field));\n}",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 53,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 53,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "1428aec17be7914fbe463e26ab483878fa620ee0",
